  "question": {
    "text": "Three containers <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> have water at different temperatures. The table below shows the final temperature <math><mi>T</mi></math> when different amounts of water (given in liters) are taken from each container and mixed (assume no loss of heat during the process)\r\r<table border=\"1px solid\">\r\t<thead>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<th><math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math></th>\r\t\t\t<th><math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math></th>\r\t\t\t<th><math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math></th>\r\t\t\t<th><math><mi>T</mi></math></th>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</thead>\r\t<tbody>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1</mn><mi>l</mi></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><math><mi>θ</mi></math></td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</tbody>\r</table>\r<br />\rThe value of <math><mi>θ</mi></math> (in <math><msup><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to the nearest integer) is___________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be the&nbsp;temperatures of water in three containers.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>60</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> &hellip;. (1)<br /><math><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>30</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> &hellip;&hellip; (2)<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>60</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> &hellip;. (3)<br />and <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br />from (1)+(2)+(3)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>450</mn><mo>&#10233;</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math><br />from (4) equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>",
